# CanvasKit's WASM. Skia on web is this binary, and it is served from public/
# so the fetch is same-origin rather than off a CDN. It is a byte-for-byte
# copy of a file in node_modules — 8MB of build output — so it is generated,
# not committed: `npm run skia:web`, which `npm run web` does for you.
public/canvaskit.wasm
